    {
      "id": "JFgW9qeFbCFklTpplS7Au",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1183.179961939453,
      "y": 158,
      "width": 473.77972412109375,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 954936321,
      "version": 827,
      "versionNonce": 460569473,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792677997219,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. GPU: the whole chip. Everything lives below it.\n\n2. GPC: a group of SMs. Mostly invisible\nto your code.\n\n3. SM (STREAMING MULTIPROCESSOR): \nOne block of threads runs on one SM, \nstart to finish.\n\n4. CORE: Does one thread's arithmetic.\nMany per SM, all identical.\n\n5. CONTROL: Picks which instructions the cores\nexecute next. Shared by the SM.\n\n6. ON-CHIP MEMORY: small, fast, shared by one\nSM (registers, shared memory).\n\n7. MEMORY CONTROLLER: Moves data\nbetween SMs and global memory.\n\n8. GLOBAL MEMORY: Big, slow, off-chip. Your\n`DeviceBuffer` lives here.\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. GPU: the whole chip. Everything lives below it.\n\n2. GPC: a group of SMs. Mostly invisible\nto your code.\n\n3. SM (STREAMING MULTIPROCESSOR): \nOne block of threads runs on one SM, \nstart to finish.\n\n4. CORE: Does one thread's arithmetic.\nMany per SM, all identical.\n\n5. CONTROL: Picks which instructions the cores\nexecute next. Shared by the SM.\n\n6. ON-CHIP MEMORY: small, fast, shared by one\nSM (registers, shared memory).\n\n7. MEMORY CONTROLLER: Moves data\nbetween SMs and global memory.\n\n8. GLOBAL MEMORY: Big, slow, off-chip. Your\n`DeviceBuffer` lives here.\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SsSvFMcIuKTXqfP-N9o1k",
